# <type>(<scope>): <subject>  (max 72 chars)
#
# Types:
#   feat     - new feature
#   fix      - bug fix
#   refactor - code change yang gak nambah feature / fix bug
#   docs     - dokumentasi
#   chore    - tooling, deps, build config
#   test     - tambah/fix test
#   perf     - perf improvement
#   ci       - CI/CD config
#
# Scopes (per arise-api module):
#   auth, users, profiles, awakening, stats, quests, workouts, worship,
#   ranks, penalties, body-measurements, notifications, ai-coach, dungeons,
#   integrations, prisma, config, health, common, scripts, deps
#
# Subject: imperative, lowercase, no period at end
#   Good: "feat(auth): add JWT refresh endpoint"
#   Bad:  "Added JWT refresh endpoint."
#
# ── Body (optional, after blank line) ──
# Jelasin WHY, bukan WHAT. Wrap di 72 chars.
#
# ── Footer (optional) ──
# Refs: #issue-number
# Breaking: BREAKING CHANGE: <description>
# Co-authored-by: Name <email>
